      x: '<p><b class="rd">Fikr bildirish</b>: <b>In my opinion</b>, … • <b>I think / believe / feel (that)</b> … • <b>As far as I’m concerned</b>, … • <b>Personally</b>, I … • <b>It seems to me that</b> …</p><p>Yumshoq ohang uchun: <b>I tend to think</b>, <b>I’d say that</b>, <b>If you ask me</b>. Kuchli fikr uchun: <b>I’m convinced that</b>, <b>I strongly believe</b>.</p><p>Inkorda: ✗ I don’t think it will work → ✓ <b>I don’t think</b> it will work (inkor birinchi qismga qo‘yiladi: “I think it won’t” emas).</p>',
      key: ['*In my opinion* • *I believe (that)* • *Personally, I* …', 'I *don’t think* it will work (inkor birinchi qismda)'],
