      x: '<p><b class="rd">Iltimos</b>: <b>Could you</b> help me? • <b>Would you</b> open the window? • <b>Would you mind</b> waiting? (javob: <b>Not at all</b> = xursand bo‘laman). • <b>Can I ask you</b> a favour?</p><p><b class="rd">Qabul</b>: <b>Of course</b> • <b>Sure</b> • <b>With pleasure</b> • <b>I’d love to</b>.<br><b class="rd">Rad etish</b> (xushmuomala): <b>I’m afraid I can’t</b> • <b>I’d love to, but</b> … • <b>Sorry, I’m busy</b>.</p><p><b>I’d like to</b> + V (xohlayman, xushmuomala), <b>I’d rather</b> + V (afzal ko‘raman): «I’d rather help at the shelter.»</p>',
