      x: '<p><b class="rd">Past Simple</b> — tugagan voqea: «I <b>visited</b> Rome last year.» <b class="rd">Past Continuous</b> — o‘tmishdagi jarayon: «I <b>was walking</b> when it started to rain.» <b class="rd">Past Perfect</b> — o‘tmishdagi boshqa voqeadan oldin: «When I arrived, she <b>had left</b>.» <b class="rd">Past Perfect Continuous</b> — oldingi davomiylik: «I <b>had been waiting</b> for an hour.»</p><p>Hikoyada: Past Simple (asosiy voqealar) + Past Continuous (fon) + Past Perfect (undan oldin).</p>',
