      x: '<p>Kelajak: <b class="rd">will</b> (qaror, fikr), <b class="rd">going to</b> (reja), <b class="rd">am doing</b> (kelishilgan), <b class="rd">Present Simple</b> (jadval), <b class="rd">will be doing</b> (aniq paytda jarayon), <b class="rd">will have done</b> (shu paytgacha tugagan).</p><p>Shartli gaplar: <b class="rd">Zero</b> (If you heat ice, it melts), <b class="rd">First</b> (If it rains, I’ll stay), <b class="rd">Second</b> (If I won, I’d buy), <b class="rd">Third</b> (If I’d known, I’d have called).</p>',
